WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.565 --> 00:00:01.668
- [Narrator] High up in the Cordillera

00:00:01.668 --> 00:00:04.085
mountains in the Philippines,

00:00:04.956 --> 00:00:08.920
in the village of Buscalan, lives a woman

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:11.795
who is the last of her kind.

00:00:11.795 --> 00:00:14.712
(foreign language)

00:00:28.332 --> 00:00:31.249
(bustling village)

00:00:33.958 --> 00:00:36.144
- Mambabatok is the name
given to the traditional

00:00:36.144 --> 00:00:39.671
tattoo artist of the Kalinga ethnic group.

00:00:39.671 --> 00:00:41.345
The artists are masters of
their thousand-year-old trade.

00:00:41.345 --> 00:00:46.345
Originally giving tattoos to
warriors who won in battle.

00:00:46.431 --> 00:00:49.348
(foreign language)

00:01:01.798 --> 00:01:03.965
(tapping)

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:09.279
- Every year thousands of
tourists make the journey

00:01:09.279 --> 00:01:13.529
to see Whang-Od and get
one of her famous tattoos.

00:01:14.391 --> 00:01:17.308
(foreign language)

00:01:56.671 --> 00:02:00.162
- Whang-Od is now the last
mambabatok, but she's teaching

00:02:00.162 --> 00:02:04.582
her grand niece to carry
on the family tradition.

00:02:04.582 --> 00:02:07.499
(foreign language)

